          "text": "History of childhood Legg-Calve-Perthes disease of the right hip"
        },
        "note": [
          {
            "text": "Reported by patient. Treated at a children's hospital in Sydney without surgery; discharged in his teens. Current symptoms assessed as more likely degenerative change from old Perthes disease than recurrence."
          }
        ]
      }
    },
